      "fTerm": "BRAIDING OR MANUFACTURE OF LACE, INCLUDING BOBBIN-NET OR CARBONISED LACE; BRAIDING MACHINES; BRAID; LACE (machines for making soles from strips of material <b>A43D 29/00</b>; cane working <b>B27J 1/00</b>)",
