      "fTerm": "MAKING NETS BY KNOTTING OF FILAMENTARY MATERIAL; MAKING KNOTTED CARPETS OR TAPESTRIES; KNOTTING NOT OTHERWISE PROVIDED FOR (binding knotters for harvesters <b>A01D 59/04</b>; wire netting <b>B21F</b>; tying articles by knotting <b>B65B</b>; knotting in association with winding or unwinding <b>B65H 69/00</b>; knotting in weaving <b>D03J</b>)",
