      "fTerm": "DRY-CLEANING, WASHING OR BLEACHING FIBRES, FILAMENTS, THREADS, YARNS, FABRICS, FEATHERS OR MADE-UP FIBROUS GOODS; BLEACHING LEATHER OR FURS<br><br><b><u>Note(s)</u></b><br><br><ul type=\"\"1\"\"><li>In this subclass, the term &ldquo;bleaching&rdquo; also <u>covers</u> &ldquo;optical bleaching&rdquo;.<b>[2017.01]</b></li><li>This subclass <u>does not cover</u> treatment of textiles by purely mechanical means, which is covered by subclasses <b>D06B</b>, <b>D06C</b> or <b>D06F</b>.</li></ul>",
